# Bot1 discards Satoru and Llanowar Elves to Faithless Looting, then Raise the Past returns both to the battlefield at
# once. Neither was cast, so "none of them were cast" holds, and Satoru and the Elves are one batch of entering creatures
# (CR 603.2c, 603.6a): one card is drawn, not two. Looting draws the Elves and an Island and discards Satoru and the Elves,
# so with Raise the Past gone Bot1's hand is that Island, and the Island Satoru draws makes it 2 (two draws would make it 3).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
Faithless Looting
Raise the Past
Satoru, the Infiltrator
Llanowar Elves
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

